(583, 'section', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Section', 'created', 54, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":54,\"formation_id\":16,\"title\":\"Finitions et Protections\",\"description\":\"Module 3 de la formation.\",\"order_position\":3,\"duration\":120,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(584, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 115, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":115,\"section_id\":52,\"title\":\"Diagnostic des supports\",\"content\":\"# Diagnostic des supports\\n\\n## Types\\n- Pl\\u00e2tre : poreux, sous-couche.\\n- B\\u00e9ton : lisse, \\u00e0 traiter.\\n- Bois : noeuds \\u00e0 bloquer.\\n- M\\u00e9tal : antirouille.\\n\\n## Traitements\\n- Nettoyage, d\\u00e9capage.\\n- Rebouchage des trous et fissures.\\n- Traitement moisissures (eau de javel\\/fongicide).\\n\\n## Test d\'adh\\u00e9rence\\nQuadrillage + ruban adh\\u00e9sif : si d\\u00e9collement, support non sain.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":true,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Analyser et pr\\u00e9parer les surfaces.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(585, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 116, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":116,\"section_id\":52,\"title\":\"Enduits de lissage et rebouchage\",\"content\":\"# Enduits\\n\\n## Types\\n- **Rebouchage** : petits trous.\\n- **Lissage** : grandes surfaces (1\\u20133 mm).\\n- **Garnissage** : d\\u00e9fauts profonds (5\\u201310 mm).\\n- **Finition** : derni\\u00e8re passe.\\n\\n## Application\\n1. Au couteau \\u00e0 enduire.\\n2. Lisser en croisant.\\n3. Pon\\u00e7age (grain 120\\u2013180).\\n4. D\\u00e9poussi\\u00e9rage.\\n\\n## S\\u00e9chage\\n- Poudre : 30\\u201360 min.\\n- Pr\\u00eat \\u00e0 l\'emploi : 2\\u20134 h.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Obtenir une surface parfaitement lisse.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(586, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 117, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":117,\"section_id\":52,\"title\":\"Sous-couches et primaires\",\"content\":\"# Sous-couches\\n\\n## R\\u00f4le\\n1. Uniformiser l\'absorption.\\n2. Am\\u00e9liorer l\'adh\\u00e9rence.\\n3. Masquer les diff\\u00e9rences de couleur.\\n\\n## Par support\\n| Support | Primaire |\\n|---|---|\\n| Pl\\u00e2tre neuf | Acrylique |\\n| B\\u00e9ton | Accrochage |\\n| Bois | Anti-n\\u0153uds |\\n| M\\u00e9tal | Antirouille |\\n| Ancienne peinture satin\\u00e9e | Adh\\u00e9rence |\\n\\n## Application\\n1 couche, pon\\u00e7age l\\u00e9ger grain 180 apr\\u00e8s s\\u00e9chage.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":25,\"order_position\":3,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Garantir l\'adh\\u00e9rence de la peinture.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(587, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 118, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":118,\"section_id\":53,\"title\":\"Application au rouleau et pinceau\",\"content\":\"# Application\\n\\n## Rouleau\\n- Manchon \\u00e0 poils longs (plafond), courts (lisse).\\n- Tracer un W, croiser sans recharger.\\n\\n## Pinceau\\n- Plat (grandes surfaces), rond (d\\u00e9tails).\\n- Brosse \\u00e0 rechampir (finitions).\\n\\n## Pistolet\\n- Airless (grandes surfaces).\\n- Pneumatique (finition soign\\u00e9e).\\n\\n## Ordre\\n1. Plafond.\\n2. Murs (haut \\u2192 bas).\\n3. Boiseries.\\n4. Sol.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Les gestes professionnels.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(588, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 119, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":119,\"section_id\":53,\"title\":\"Papiers peints et rev\\u00eatements\",\"content\":\"# Rev\\u00eatements muraux\\n\\n## Types\\n- Papier traditionnel.\\n- **Intiss\\u00e9** : colle au mur, se retire \\u00e0 sec.\\n- Toile de verre : \\u00e0 peindre apr\\u00e8s pose.\\n- Vinyle : lessivable.\\n\\n## Pose intiss\\u00e9\\n1. Encollage du mur.\\n2. Pose du l\\u00e9.\\n3. Marouflage (centre \\u2192 bords).\\n4. D\\u00e9coupe cutter.\\n5. Raccord bord \\u00e0 bord.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Pose de papier peint, intiss\\u00e9 et toile de verre.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(589, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 120, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":120,\"section_id\":53,\"title\":\"Effets d\\u00e9coratifs\",\"content\":\"# Effets d\\u00e9coratifs\\n\\n## Patine\\n- \\u00c0 l\'\\u00e9ponge, au chiffon ou \\u00e0 la brosse.\\n\\n## Stuc\\n- \\u00c0 la chaux (aspect pierre) ou \\u00e0 l\'huile (effet marbre).\\n- 5\\u201310 couches fines.\\n\\n## B\\u00e9ton cir\\u00e9\\n- 1\\u20133 mm au couteau \\u00e0 enduire.\\n- Finition satin\\u00e9e ou mate.\\n\\n## Tadelakt\\n- Enduit chaux marocain.\\n- 3 couches, lissage \\u00e0 la pierre d\'agate.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":3,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Patine, stuc, b\\u00e9ton cir\\u00e9, tadelakt.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(590, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 121, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":121,\"section_id\":54,\"title\":\"Lasures et vernis\",\"content\":\"# Lasures et vernis\\n\\n## Lasure\\n- Micro-poreuse (ext\\u00e9rieur).\\n- Satin\\u00e9e (int\\u00e9rieur).\\n- Entretien : 3\\u20135 ans.\\n\\n## Vernis\\n- Brillant (parquet vitrifi\\u00e9).\\n- Satin\\u00e9 (meubles).\\n- Mat (\\u00e9b\\u00e9nisterie).\\n\\n## Application vernis\\n1. Pon\\u00e7age grain 240.\\n2. D\\u00e9poussi\\u00e9rage.\\n3. Couche fine.\\n4. Pon\\u00e7age entre couches grain 320.\\n5. 2\\u20134 couches.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Prot\\u00e9ger et sublimer les boiseries.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(591, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 122, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":122,\"section_id\":54,\"title\":\"Peinture de sols et r\\u00e9sines\",\"content\":\"# Sols et r\\u00e9sines\\n\\n## Peinture sol\\n- Acrylique ou polyur\\u00e9thane.\\n- D\\u00e9capage + d\\u00e9graissage pr\\u00e9alable.\\n\\n## R\\u00e9sines\\n- **\\u00c9poxy** : haute r\\u00e9sistance m\\u00e9canique et chimique.\\n- **Polyur\\u00e9thane** : souple, r\\u00e9sistante UV.\\n- **Mortier autonivelant** : sols industriels.\\n\\n## Application \\u00e9poxy\\n1. Primaire d\'accrochage.\\n2. M\\u00e9lange r\\u00e9sine + durcisseur.\\n3. Raclette crant\\u00e9e.\\n4. D\\u00e9bullage (rouleau \\u00e0 picots).\\n5. Polym\\u00e9risation 24\\u201348 h.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Rev\\u00eatements techniques et d\\u00e9coratifs.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(592, 'exam', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Exam', 'created', 24, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":24,\"examable_type\":\"App\\\\Models\\\\Section\",\"examable_id\":52,\"title\":\"\\u00c9valuation \\u2014 Pr\\u00e9paration des Supports\",\"description\":\"\\u00c9valuation obligatoire pour valider cette \\u00e9tape.\",\"instructions\":\"R\\u00e9pondez \\u00e0 toutes les questions. L\'ordre change \\u00e0 chaque nouvelle tentative.\",\"duration_minutes\":20,\"passing_score\":70,\"max_attempts\":3,\"randomize_questions\":true,\"show_results_immediately\":true,\"is_active\":true,\"available_from\":\"2026-07-26 20:42:33\",\"available_until\":\"2028-07-27 20:42:33\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
