(650, 'section', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Section', 'created', 57, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":57,\"formation_id\":17,\"title\":\"M\\u00e9tallerie du B\\u00e2timent\",\"description\":\"Module 3 de la formation.\",\"order_position\":3,\"duration\":180,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(651, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 123, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":123,\"section_id\":55,\"title\":\"Proc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s de soudage\",\"content\":\"# Proc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s\\n\\n## Arc (MMA\\/SMAW)\\n- \\u00c9lectrode enrob\\u00e9e, arc \\u00e9lectrique.\\n- Acier carbone, simple et polyvalent.\\n\\n## MIG\\/MAG (GMAW)\\n- MIG : gaz inerte (Ar) pour alu\\/inox.\\n- MAG : gaz actif (CO\\u2082) pour acier.\\n- Fil d\\u00e9vid\\u00e9 en continu, productif.\\n\\n## TIG (GTAW)\\n- \\u00c9lectrode tungst\\u00e8ne non fusible.\\n- Haute qualit\\u00e9, inox\\/alu\\/titane.\\n\\n## Oxycoupage\\n- D\\u00e9coupe par oxydation.\\n- Acier 5\\u2013300 mm.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":true,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Arc, MIG\\/MAG, TIG, oxycoupage.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(652, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 124, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":124,\"section_id\":55,\"title\":\"M\\u00e9taux d\'apport et gaz\",\"content\":\"# M\\u00e9taux d\'apport et gaz\\n\\n## M\\u00e9taux d\'apport\\n| Proc\\u00e9d\\u00e9 | Apport |\\n|---|---|\\n| Arc rutile | Acier g\\u00e9n\\u00e9ral |\\n| Arc basique | Acier \\u00e9pais |\\n| MIG fil massif | Acier, alu |\\n| TIG baguette | Inox, alu |\\n\\n## Gaz\\n| Gaz | Usage |\\n|---|---|\\n| Argon 100 % | TIG, MIG alu\\/inox |\\n| CO\\u2082 100 % | MAG acier |\\n| Ar\\/CO\\u2082 82\\/18 | MAG acier |\\n\\n## S\\u00e9curit\\u00e9\\n- Stockage debout, cha\\u00een\\u00e9.\\n- D\\u00e9tendeur adapt\\u00e9.\\n- Ventilation obligatoire.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Choix du m\\u00e9tal d\'apport et du gaz.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(653, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 125, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":125,\"section_id\":55,\"title\":\"S\\u00e9curit\\u00e9 en soudage\",\"content\":\"# S\\u00e9curit\\u00e9\\n\\n## EPI\\n- Casque \\u00e0 filtre auto (DIN 5\\u201313).\\n- Gants cuir longs.\\n- V\\u00eatements ignifug\\u00e9s.\\n- Chaussures s\\u00e9curit\\u00e9.\\n- Masque \\u00e0 cartouche (fum\\u00e9es).\\n\\n## Risques\\n| Risque | Pr\\u00e9vention |\\n|---|---|\\n| Br\\u00fblures | EPI + \\u00e9cran |\\n| Fum\\u00e9es toxiques | Ventilation |\\n| Incendie | Extincteur |\\n| \\u00c9lectrocution | C\\u00e2bles OK, mise \\u00e0 terre |\\n\\n## R\\u00e8gles\\n- Zone ventil\\u00e9e.\\n- \\u00c9cran autour de la zone.\\n- Attendre refroidissement.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":25,\"order_position\":3,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"EPI et pr\\u00e9vention des risques.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(654, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 126, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":126,\"section_id\":56,\"title\":\"Soudage des aciers\",\"content\":\"# Soudage des aciers\\n\\n## Acier carbone\\n- Pr\\u00e9paration : brossage, meulage.\\n- Pr\\u00e9chauffage > 30 mm (150\\u2013300 \\u00b0C).\\n- Param\\u00e8tres MAG : 18\\u201322 V, 150\\u2013250 A.\\n- Vitesse : 25\\u201345 cm\\/min.\\n\\n## Inox\\n- TIG baguette ER308L, Argon 100 %.\\n- Risque : sensibilisation 450\\u2013850 \\u00b0C.\\n\\n## D\\u00e9fauts\\n| D\\u00e9faut | Cause |\\n|---|---|\\n| Porosit\\u00e9 | Manque gaz |\\n| Manque p\\u00e9n\\u00e9tration | Intensit\\u00e9 faible |\\n| Crique | Refroidissement rapide |\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Param\\u00e8tres pour acier carbone et alli\\u00e9.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(655, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 127, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":127,\"section_id\":56,\"title\":\"Soudage de l\'aluminium\",\"content\":\"# Soudage aluminium\\n\\n## Particularit\\u00e9s\\n- Oxyde d\'alumine (fusion \\u00e0 2050 \\u00b0C).\\n- Conductivit\\u00e9 thermique \\u00e9lev\\u00e9e.\\n- Dilatation importante.\\n\\n## TIG\\n- Courant alternatif (AC).\\n- Tungst\\u00e8ne thori\\u00e9 \\u00d8 2,4 mm.\\n- Baguette ER4043 ou ER5356.\\n- Argon 10\\u201315 L\\/min.\\n\\n## MIG\\n- Pistolet push-pull.\\n- Fil ER4043\\/ER5356 \\u00d8 1,0\\u20131,6 mm.\\n- 20\\u201324 V, 150\\u2013250 A.\\n\\n## D\\u00e9fauts\\n- Craquelures (fissuration \\u00e0 chaud).\\n- Porosit\\u00e9 (hydrog\\u00e8ne).\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":30,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Particularit\\u00e9s de l\'aluminium.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(656, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 128, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":128,\"section_id\":57,\"title\":\"Serrurerie et ferronnerie\",\"content\":\"# Serrurerie\\n\\n## Portails\\n- Tube acier 40\\u00d740 ou 60\\u00d760 mm.\\n- Galvanis\\u00e9 + thermolaquage.\\n- Serrure 3 points, motorisation.\\n\\n## Garde-corps\\n- Hauteur : \\u2265 100 cm (tertiaire), \\u2265 90 cm (logement).\\n- \\u00c9cartement \\u2264 11 cm (s\\u00e9curit\\u00e9 enfants).\\n- Main courante \\u00d8 40\\u201350 mm.\\n\\n## Ferronnerie d\\u00e9corative\\n- Volutes cintr\\u00e9es \\u00e0 chaud\\/froid.\\n- Fers plats 20\\u00d75 mm, carr\\u00e9s 12\\u00d712 mm.\\n- Norme NF P 01-012, NF EN 1090.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":1,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Portails, rampes, garde-corps.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
(657, 'chapter', 'created', 'App\\Models\\Chapter', 'created', 129, NULL, NULL, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":129,\"section_id\":57,\"title\":\"Charpentes m\\u00e9talliques\",\"content\":\"# Charpentes m\\u00e9talliques\\n\\n## Profils\\n- **IPE** : port\\u00e9es jusqu\'\\u00e0 15 m.\\n- **HEA\\/HEB** : fortes charges.\\n- **UPN** : pannes, lisses.\\n- **RHS\\/SHS** : poteaux, poutres.\\n\\n## Conception\\n- Eurocode 3 (NF EN 1993).\\n- Assemblages boulonn\\u00e9s (HR) ou soud\\u00e9s.\\n- Contreventement (croix Saint-Andr\\u00e9).\\n\\n## Fabrication\\n1. Trac\\u00e9 et d\\u00e9bit.\\n2. Per\\u00e7age.\\n3. Soudage atelier (MAG\\/arc).\\n4. Grenaillage + peinture.\\n5. Marquage et contr\\u00f4le.\",\"content_type\":\"text\",\"media_url\":null,\"video_url\":null,\"cover_image\":null,\"markdown_file\":null,\"processing_status\":null,\"processing_error\":null,\"processing_metadata\":null,\"processing_started_at\":null,\"processed_at\":null,\"duration_minutes\":35,\"order_position\":2,\"is_free\":false,\"is_active\":true,\"description\":\"Profils, fabrication, montage.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-27T20:42:33.000000Z\"},\"ip_address\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"user_agent\":\"Symfony\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/formations.btpcma.org\"}', NULL, '2026-07-28 00:42:33', '2026-07-28 00:42:33'),
